and the walk was reading three and four copies of every test file. Distinct
counting hid it in both directions. Nested checkouts are now excluded.

The earlier claim keeps the id in each of the three collisions; the runs
view's two cases and the fourth verdict's badge take new ones. The mapping,
the dates it was measured from and the reservations that moved are recorded
in the catalog.

